{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:cae1804f495e61f3","name":"Sith War Sword","source":{"id":"source:reference-cae1804f495e61f3","title":"Sith War Sword","revision":22573,"timestamp":"2024-09-05T14:12:17Z","sha256":"44b4452ac22f0daffde2c658f1068e1c5b29f92fc45e1249688d03efa075be11","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=22573","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Sith%20War%20Sword&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-cae1804f495e61f3","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Knights of the Old Republic Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Knights_of_the_Old_Republic_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The prized weapons of ancient Sith Lords, the Sith War Sword is an incredibly sharp blade treated with ancient Sith Alchemy to produce a deadly weapon. Sith War Swords are ",{"tag":"a","children":["War Swords"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/War_Swords"}," with the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Sith Alchemical Weapon Template"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Sith_Alchemical_Weapon_Template","referenceId":"reference:cf604f4a2cba365a"},". ",{"tag":"a","children":["Lightsabers"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lightsabers","referenceId":"reference:420c60d0a682943a"}," do not ignore a Sith War Sword's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Damage Reduction"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Damage_Reduction"},", and the characters who are proficient with the Sith War Sword can treat it as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Lightsaber"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lightsaber","referenceId":"reference:987a817de9003439"}," for the purpose of using the ",{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Block"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Block"}]},", ",{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Deflect"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Deflect"}]},", and ",{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Redirect Shot"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Redirect_Shot"}]}," Talents (as well as any ",{"tag":"a","children":["Talents"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Talents","referenceId":"reference:e8871b70ebfa07d9"}," that have those Talents as a prerequisite).\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Additionally, a character proficient with a Sith War Sword can spend a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Point"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Point"}," as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Swift Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Swift_Action"}," to gain a bonus to damage rolls with the Sith War Sword equal to his or her ",{"tag":"a","children":["Dark Side Score"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dark_Side_Score"},". This bonus to damage applies to the next attack made with the Sith War Sword before the end of the encounter, and activating this ability increases the wielder's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Dark Side Score"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dark_Side_Score"}," by 1.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Weapon Type:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Simple Weapons (Melee)"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Simple_Weapons_(Melee)","referenceId":"reference:cd7a4aafaae07eb3"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Size:"]}," Medium\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Cost:"]}," 2,050\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Damage:"]}," 1d8\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Weight:"]}," 2 Kilograms\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Type:"]}," Slashing or Piercing\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Availability:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Rare"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Rare"},"\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
